# CODEOWNERS - infrastructure, database, security, deployment ownership.
# Platform team is the primary owner of CI/CD workflows and infrastructure.
# Database team owns migration and schema changes.
# Security team owns scanning configuration and allowlists.
# Release engineering owns the release pipeline.

# CI/CD workflows
/.github/workflows/            @jntucej/platform
/.github/CODEOWNERS            @jntucej/platform

# Infrastructure
/docker-compose.yml            @jntucej/platform
